s CEO just days after rejecting his offer to return&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[金融时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.ft.com/content/82d3be02-8ac7-4acb-aefa-6e3722ee05cc?syn-25a6b1a6=1'&gt;游说特朗普带回黄仁勋的“作战室”&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Inside the ‘war room’ that lobbied Trump to bring back Jensen Huang&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[纽约时报]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/23/technology/jensen-huang-nvidia-board-trump.html'&gt;随着黄仁勋重新担任首席执行官，特朗普实际上凌驾于英伟达董事会之上&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：With Jensen Huang’s Return as C.E.O., Trump Effectively Overrode Nvidia’s Board&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-jensen-huang-ceo-return.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:20:33 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[CNBC] 赛诺菲同意收购制药商 Insmed，这是该公司三年来最大的一笔交易，其股价上涨 14%</title><link>https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/insmed-sanofi-deal-stock-pharma.html</link><description>赛诺菲在本世纪末面临着收入下降，因为最畅销的药物失去了排他性，并为仿制药制造商开放了竞争空间。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[CNBC]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/insmed-sanofi-deal-stock-pharma.html'&gt;赛诺菲同意收购制药商 Insmed，这是该公司三年来最大的一笔交易，其股价上涨 14%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Drugmaker Insmed shares rally 14% after Sanofi agrees to buy it in pharma’s biggest deal in three years&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/insmed-sanofi-deal-stock-pharma.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:35:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>[彭博社] 深圳征服了科技，现在它需要文化（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/shenzhen-conquered-tech-now-it-wants-culture-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处（共 1 家，点击查阅原文）：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[彭博社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-24/shenzhen-conquered-tech-now-it-wants-culture-video'&gt;深圳征服了科技，现在它需要文化（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Sh