tml'&gt;Nvidia 和 A.I. 股市下跌股市抹去了周一的部分涨势&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Stock Markets Slip as Nvidia and A.I. Stocks Erase Some of Monday’s Rally&lt;/small&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;[路透社]&lt;/b&gt; &lt;a href='https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQSTdTSVk1YVg0WC1SRVJKVW1XYTZJbjRhRVctYkNzZHZRcW5TaVE3MVdSd2JfYUNaV3otX1FzR1lxYkwyWWZtbS1ONDdiem9UVUI0ckV6c2tiOEt0TGViNlUxZFdSeDV0aVJ4cjZkSkE5Nk9veE1UTmxad0xxaXhScndGMV9IdWVrNUpOQnY0Y0hXVmpZVFgwbTFQMDZiX0NqdExaejlYMzJnbjg?oc=5'&gt;芯片股在英伟达推动上涨后降温，华尔街期货下跌&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall St futures dip as chip stocks cool after Nvidia-fueled rally&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/23/stock-market-today-live-updates.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 14:39:22 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>